---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout>
  <section class="intro">
    <h1><img src="/backplane.svg" width="80" height="80" alt="" />backplane</h1>
    <p>An open workspace for agentic hardware development.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/download">Download</a><a class="btn" href="https://github.com/i2cjak/backplane">Source code ↗</a></div>
    <hr />
    <ol>
      <li>Bring your coding agents into the same workspace as your boards, schematics, and fabrication files.</li>
      <li>Work locally or connect to your environment from desktop, web, and mobile.</li>
      <li>Backplane is independent, open source, and built for electrical engineers.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="credit">by <a href="https://x.com/i2cjak">@i2cjak ↗</a></p>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .intro { width: min(100%, 540px); margin: 10vh auto 0; }
  h1 { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .5em; font-size: clamp(32px, 7vw, 48px); letter-spacing: -.055em; }
  p { margin: 28px 0; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  hr { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #555b50; margin: 32px 0; }
  ol { padding-left: 1.6em; }
  li + li { margin-top: 16px; }
  .credit { color: #a7afa0; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; }
</style>
